      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following customer email:\nSubject: {{ $(\"Extract Customer Email\").item.json.subject }}\nBody: {{ $(\"Extract Customer Email\").item.json.emailBody }}\n\nDetermine:\n- sentiment: one of (calm, neutral, frustrated, angry, critical)\n- emotionalTone: one of (calm, concerned, frustrated, angry, panicked)\n- frustrationLevel: one of (none, low, medium, high, extreme)\n- escalationRisk: one of (none, low, medium, high, critical)\n\nYou MUST return ONLY valid JSON matching this exact structure:\n{\n  \"sentiment\": \"frustrated\",\n  \"emotionalTone\": \"urgent\",\n  \"frustrationLevel\": \"high\",\n  \"escalationRisk\": \"medium\"\n}\n\nDo not include any explanatory text, only the JSON object.",
